1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
=Godslayer=
(Adapted from the novel Godslayer.)

2
00:00:34,330 --> 00:00:36,000
(Human desires)

3
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,120
(are but a poisoned wine
that clouds the heart.)

4
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,910
(Drink it,)

5
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,120
(and you will abandon your true self
and pride,)

6
00:00:44,950 --> 00:00:49,500
(willingly bow before desire.)

7
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:04,290
(Primordial Mirror Pool)

8
00:01:04,290 --> 00:01:05,450
Lu Yuanqing.

9
00:01:05,830 --> 00:01:07,120
You made it this far,

10
00:01:07,290 --> 00:01:09,000
which proves you are stronger
than them all.

11
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:11,500
We admire the strong.

12
00:01:16,410 --> 00:01:19,120
I can change the fate

13
00:01:19,250 --> 00:01:21,000
of your sister and all half-monsters.

14
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:25,250
Do you really think I would believe you?

15
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:27,120
You don't have to believe me.

16
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:29,870
But the Primordial Mirror never lies.

17
00:01:30,750 --> 00:01:33,729
That pool before you
is the Primordial Mirror.

18
00:01:33,771 --> 00:01:37,160
Its illusions follow
only cause and effect,

19
00:01:37,250 --> 00:01:38,660
and reveal only one's true heart.

20
00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:40,660
If you wish to reach Yuyou Village,

21
00:01:40,910 --> 00:01:42,290
you cannot avoid it.

22
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:47,290
The person you seek
is waiting for you within.

23
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,620
Do you dare enter

24
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:54,540
and face your truest desire?

25
00:02:00,370 --> 00:02:02,580
Do you dare enter

26
00:02:03,870 --> 00:02:10,870
and face your truest desire?

27
00:02:15,540 --> 00:02:17,139
(Hurry up.)

28
00:02:17,181 --> 00:02:17,889
Okay. Okay.

29
00:02:17,931 --> 00:02:18,910
(Move everything inside.)

30
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:19,830
Okay. Okay.

31
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:21,790
Lord Lu.

32
00:02:24,580 --> 00:02:25,410
Lord Lu.

33
00:02:26,540 --> 00:02:28,039
Lord Lu.

34
00:02:28,081 --> 00:02:29,410
What brings you here?

35
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:31,539
Tomorrow is your sister's wedding day.

36
00:02:31,581 --> 00:02:32,769
Shouldn't you be making preparations
at home?

37
00:02:32,811 --> 00:02:34,290
Why are you here instead?

38
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:36,910
Lord Lu.

39
00:02:40,330 --> 00:02:40,870
Zhu Si?

40
00:02:41,580 --> 00:02:42,950
Here, take this.

41
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:45,769
This red carp

42
00:02:45,811 --> 00:02:46,929
was personally chosen by me.

43
00:02:46,971 --> 00:02:48,700
May the newlyweds enjoy abundance
year after year,

44
00:02:48,830 --> 00:02:49,910
and a prosperous future.

45
00:02:50,700 --> 00:02:54,410
When you avenged Ahai
in the Blood Arena,

46
00:02:54,660 --> 00:02:55,660
I knew then

47
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:58,290
that one day half-monsters would rise.

48
00:02:58,450 --> 00:03:00,910
Now we half-monsters stand above,

49
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:03,620
while Heavenwrights mine below for us.

50
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:06,120
It is all thanks to that battle
you fought.

51
00:03:06,910 --> 00:03:08,540
Your kindness toward us half-monsters

52
00:03:08,660 --> 00:03:10,450
will never be forgotten for generations.

53
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:27,850
=Episode 11=
(Not One Less)

54
00:03:28,270 --> 00:03:30,139
(Lu Residence)

55
00:03:30,181 --> 00:03:32,040
It's crooked. A little higher.

56
00:03:32,870 --> 00:03:33,870
Which side?

57
00:03:34,250 --> 00:03:35,250
This side?

58
00:03:35,330 --> 00:03:36,330
Almost. Almost.

59
00:03:36,620 --> 00:03:38,000
Which side is lower? Here?

60
00:03:38,370 --> 00:03:39,370
That's good. That's good.

61
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,540
Yuanqing is back.

62
00:03:42,660 --> 00:03:44,330
Zhu gave us this fish, didn't he?

63
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:46,700
Give it to me.

64
00:03:47,410 --> 00:03:48,540
I'll take it to the kitchen.

65
00:03:53,330 --> 00:03:54,479
Perfect timing.

66
00:03:54,521 --> 00:03:55,889
The chief keeps saying
I put it on crooked.

67
00:03:55,931 --> 00:03:57,160
Come take a look.

68
00:03:59,450 --> 00:04:00,830
Is it still crooked?

69
00:04:03,290 --> 00:04:04,059
Since you are here,

70
00:04:04,101 --> 00:04:05,830
come help me put up the other half.

71
00:04:09,330 --> 00:04:10,499
You take the left.

72
00:04:10,541 --> 00:04:11,200
I do the right one.

73
00:04:11,250 --> 00:04:12,330
We'll put it up together.

74
00:04:18,540 --> 00:04:20,790
What are you looking at? Hurry up.

75
00:04:31,910 --> 00:04:33,060
(Double Happiness)

76
00:04:36,970 --> 00:04:40,479
(Double Happiness)

77
00:04:40,521 --> 00:04:42,540
What a joyful day.

78
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,540
(Double Happiness)
(The auspicious hour has arrived.)

79
00:04:45,830 --> 00:04:47,410
(Proceed to the temple ceremony.)

80
00:04:52,660 --> 00:04:54,200
(The fan moves aside,
revealing the bride.)

81
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:55,830
(Two hearts united.)

82
00:04:58,330 --> 00:04:59,910
(The newlyweds offer wine.)

83
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:02,500
(Thanking their parents
for raising them.)

84
00:05:02,950 --> 00:05:04,290
(An elder brother bears
a father's duty.)

85
00:05:04,540 --> 00:05:06,660
(Receive the newlyweds' respect.)

86
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:11,370
Brother.

87
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,330
Our parents left us too soon.

88
00:05:13,450 --> 00:05:15,040
You raised me.

89
00:05:15,410 --> 00:05:16,660
Today, this cup of wine

90
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:17,830
is for you.

91
00:05:28,790 --> 00:05:29,540
Xiaoyue.

92
00:05:30,410 --> 00:05:31,660
Do you remember?

93
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,370
That winter,

94
00:05:33,620 --> 00:05:34,750
the village was hit by famine.

95
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,870
We had nothing left to eat.

96
00:05:37,910 --> 00:05:39,330
I went to the Heavenly Temple

97
00:05:39,620 --> 00:05:41,450
and stole a sesame cake from the altar.

98
00:05:43,330 --> 00:05:45,700
I remember it.

99
00:05:46,290 --> 00:05:50,040
That sesame cake was the sweetest thing
I had ever tasted.

100
00:05:53,790 --> 00:05:54,580
Xiaoyue.

101
00:05:55,910 --> 00:05:57,330
No matter where you are,

102
00:05:57,790 --> 00:05:59,290
no matter what happens,

103
00:05:59,790 --> 00:06:01,580
I only wish for your happiness.

104
00:06:02,290 --> 00:06:03,370
In this life,

105
00:06:03,870 --> 00:06:04,790
and the next,

106
00:06:05,330 --> 00:06:06,410
it will always be the same.

107
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:12,000
Yuanqing.

108
00:06:12,410 --> 00:06:14,330
We finally have a good life now.

109
00:06:14,450 --> 00:06:17,160
You'll never have to steal again.

110
00:06:17,660 --> 00:06:19,040
You'll never have to kneel
in the snow again.

111
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:20,700
You'll never have
to risk your life again.

112
00:06:21,540 --> 00:06:22,250
Yuanqing.

113
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,040
This cup of wine

114
00:06:24,330 --> 00:06:25,200
is for you.

115
00:06:37,450 --> 00:06:40,250
Drink. Come on, drink.

116
00:06:40,700 --> 00:06:42,830
Drink this wine that clouds the heart.

117
00:06:43,450 --> 00:06:45,750
This is your paradise of pleasure.

118
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:48,620
And the graveyard of heroes.

119
00:06:49,750 --> 00:06:52,700
Du really knows how to spin a tale.

120
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:54,599
What "illusions"...

121
00:06:54,641 --> 00:06:55,870
"What it reveals is one's true heart"...

122
00:06:57,080 --> 00:06:59,290
Those mortals actually believed it.

123
00:07:01,580 --> 00:07:05,700
Wang Yan fell for Du's lies back then.

124
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,370
He drank that wine

125
00:07:07,830 --> 00:07:11,540
and willingly served us as a slave
for ten years.

126
00:07:12,450 --> 00:07:13,559
After all,

127
00:07:13,601 --> 00:07:15,620
he was only a mortal being.

128
00:07:15,950 --> 00:07:17,200
His heart was still weak.

129
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:22,330
A little temptation was enough
to cloud his mind.

130
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:27,290
(Wonderful.)

131
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,080
(Wonderful.)

132
00:07:32,660 --> 00:07:34,870
(Wonderful!)

133
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:36,559
(The two of us meeting here...)

134
00:07:36,601 --> 00:07:37,620
(That must be fate.)

135
00:07:40,870 --> 00:07:42,809
(You did well, kiddo.)

136
00:07:42,851 --> 00:07:44,080
(This is your reward.)

137
00:07:54,450 --> 00:07:56,580
Why aren't you drinking?

138
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:58,979
Yuanqing.

139
00:07:59,021 --> 00:08:00,160
What are you waiting for?

140
00:08:00,540 --> 00:08:02,519
Isn't this the day
you've always dreamed of?

141
00:08:02,561 --> 00:08:03,620
Drink.

142
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,700
This is Xiaoyue's wedding wine.

143
00:08:08,580 --> 00:08:11,080
If Duo Mu could drink
today's wedding wine,

144
00:08:11,500 --> 00:08:12,950
and taste today's wedding sweets,

145
00:08:13,830 --> 00:08:15,120
he would be so happy.

146
00:08:16,620 --> 00:08:17,450
Yuanqing.

147
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:19,450
Why would you say that?

148
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:25,080
Because they should have been here.

149
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:27,250
But they aren't.

150
00:08:28,370 --> 00:08:29,200
They

151
00:08:29,910 --> 00:08:31,250
were killed by you.

152
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,019
Yuanqing.

153
00:08:33,061 --> 00:08:35,250
What do you mean?

154
00:08:37,330 --> 00:08:38,870
That year, when the village
was struck by famine,

155
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:41,580
what I brought back wasn't sesame cake.

156
00:08:42,330 --> 00:08:43,540
It was mung bean cake.

157
00:08:44,250 --> 00:08:45,500
You're not Xiaoyue.

158
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:50,540
Your little sister knows you're here.

159
00:08:50,830 --> 00:08:51,870
She's waiting for you.

160
00:08:53,410 --> 00:08:54,080
Remember,

161
00:08:54,370 --> 00:08:56,160
the Mirror Pool
is filled with illusions.

162
00:08:56,290 --> 00:08:57,679
The wine in the Primordial Mirror

163
00:08:57,721 --> 00:08:58,500
must not be drunk.

164
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:12,290
When did you figure it out?

165
00:09:13,370 --> 00:09:15,250
Last night, when I was putting up
the wedding decorations,

166
00:09:15,500 --> 00:09:16,870
I thought of Duo Mu.

167
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:19,120
I also remembered Mount Buzhou.

168
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,290
That old man guarding the temple...

169
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:24,120
That old man was you too, wasn't he?

170
00:09:25,290 --> 00:09:26,950
(Three incense sticks is the limit.)

171
00:09:27,660 --> 00:09:29,269
(Only death can end it.)

172
00:09:29,311 --> 00:09:29,889
(Yuanqing.)

173
00:09:29,931 --> 00:09:31,099
(This cup of wine)

174
00:09:31,141 --> 00:09:32,370
(is for you.)

175
00:09:33,660 --> 00:09:35,000
From that moment on,

176
00:09:35,910 --> 00:09:37,370
I became wary of you.

177
00:09:37,830 --> 00:09:39,790
I questioned every word you said.

178
00:09:40,660 --> 00:09:42,290
Because you love doing this.

179
00:09:42,750 --> 00:09:44,389
Hiding behind other people's faces,

180
00:09:44,431 --> 00:09:46,080
and manipulating their hearts.

181
00:09:47,250 --> 00:09:48,750
You were only one step away.

182
00:09:49,250 --> 00:09:51,910
If you willingly drank that cup of wine,

183
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,979
you could stay here forever.

184
00:09:54,021 --> 00:09:55,200
Wouldn't that be better?

185
00:09:55,620 --> 00:09:57,040
At the end of this path,

186
00:09:57,750 --> 00:09:58,809
everyone,

187
00:09:58,851 --> 00:10:00,160
not a single one would be lost.

188
00:10:00,620 --> 00:10:01,639
My vengeance is not yet fulfilled.

189
00:10:01,681 --> 00:10:02,660
The reckoning is not over.

190
00:10:02,870 --> 00:10:04,540
How could I indulge in happiness?

191
00:10:06,540 --> 00:10:07,910
Although this is an illusion,

192
00:10:08,250 --> 00:10:10,889
it is also your deepest desire.

193
00:10:10,931 --> 00:10:12,620
Since you long for all this,

194
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:14,059
why don't we

195
00:10:14,101 --> 00:10:15,370
have a talk?

196
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:18,040
You can become the next Wang Yan.

197
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:21,120
The fate of all half-monsters
can be changed as well.

198
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:23,910
I admit it.

199
00:10:24,660 --> 00:10:26,700
I want everything here.

200
00:10:27,500 --> 00:10:28,410
But

201
00:10:28,870 --> 00:10:30,099
if I kill you,

202
00:10:30,141 --> 00:10:32,120
I can still have all of this.

203
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,269
The only difference is,

204
00:10:34,311 --> 00:10:35,660
the road will be harder.

205
00:10:36,370 --> 00:10:37,910
But difficult roads

206
00:10:38,750 --> 00:10:39,500
are what I'm familiar with.

207
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,950
Since you refuse to see reason,

208
00:10:54,450 --> 00:10:57,000
death is your only path.

209
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,200
I never thought

210
00:11:15,580 --> 00:11:17,500
the so-called Heaven Guardian God

211
00:11:17,660 --> 00:11:20,250
would be nothing but an ugly bug.

212
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:34,080
Du is a parasite that lives
within human hearts.

213
00:12:34,450 --> 00:12:36,410
They prey on people's minds,

214
00:12:36,660 --> 00:12:38,750
twisting truth and lies.

215
00:12:38,950 --> 00:12:40,080
What do they fear?

216
00:12:40,370 --> 00:12:42,909
They use the sound of their wings
to crush their enemies.

217
00:12:42,951 --> 00:12:44,950
So they fear sound the most.

218
00:12:45,450 --> 00:12:48,620
A sound more powerful than theirs.

219
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:40,950
Look.

220
00:13:43,500 --> 00:13:44,370
Look!

221
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:47,870
The so-called god is nothing
but a giant bug!

222
00:13:48,370 --> 00:13:49,250
Impossible!

223
00:13:49,410 --> 00:13:52,250
This is what we've worshipped
for a thousand years!

224
00:13:52,870 --> 00:13:54,870
Even the Eye of Heaven Stone
can be deceived!

225
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:57,330
How could god be a mere bug?

226
00:13:57,540 --> 00:14:00,250
The heavenly thunder we cultivated
for a thousand years,

227
00:14:00,620 --> 00:14:02,370
the incense offerings we gave
for a thousand years...

228
00:14:03,500 --> 00:14:05,000
You still refuse to accept it?

229
00:14:05,410 --> 00:14:06,620
That is not god.

230
00:14:06,750 --> 00:14:08,250
It's just a giant bug.

231
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:10,450
You worshipped it your entire lives.

232
00:14:10,660 --> 00:14:11,790
You feared it your entire lives.

233
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:13,370
You killed for it your entire lives.

234
00:14:14,160 --> 00:14:15,200
And in the end,

235
00:14:15,620 --> 00:14:16,620
you worshipped a bug.

236
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:17,750
You feared it too.

237
00:14:17,870 --> 00:14:19,700
You killed countless people
for that oversized bug.

238
00:14:20,250 --> 00:14:21,179
Will you

239
00:14:21,221 --> 00:14:22,870
still keep killing for it?

240
00:14:28,500 --> 00:14:29,250
You...

241
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:35,540
You dare rebel?

242
00:14:42,750 --> 00:14:45,450
What is Yuyou Village really like?

243
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,370
Aren't you curious?

244
00:14:47,620 --> 00:14:48,500
For a thousand years,

245
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:50,750
only the Holy Maiden has ever gone up,

246
00:14:50,870 --> 00:14:52,370
and Porcelain Armored Soldiers
have come down.

247
00:14:52,870 --> 00:14:54,790
No living person has ever seen it.

248
00:14:55,370 --> 00:14:56,000
Why don't we

249
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,040
go up and see for ourselves?

250
00:14:58,370 --> 00:15:01,450
Ahai always wanted to see what lies
above Yuyou Village.

251
00:15:02,540 --> 00:15:04,580
He'll never get that chance.

252
00:15:06,750 --> 00:15:08,410
I'll go in his place!

253
00:15:09,160 --> 00:15:11,059
Let's go to Yuyou Village!

254
00:15:11,101 --> 00:15:15,700
Let's go!

255
00:15:22,020 --> 00:15:23,390
(Yuyou Village)

256
00:15:32,180 --> 00:15:33,640
(Village)
